: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></font></span></span></span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 지원자격</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY신명조; mso-font-width: 90%\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY신명조; mso-font-width: 90%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 2018학년도 3월 현재 국내 4년제 이상 대학의 1학년 또는 2학년에 재학 중인 자로서 다음 각 항을 모두 충족하는 자</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; - 4개 기초자연과학 부문 전공자 : 물리학, 화학, 생물/생명과학, 의학</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; - 대학 입학 당해 연도의 수능성적이 4개 영역 모두 4등급 이내인 자</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPAC